# Local scratch VR panoramas (owner-only). Keep them out of git so a broad
# `git add` cannot commit local panoramas. Narrow on purpose: /img/vr, /img/icons,
# and the normal app images under public/img are NOT ignored.
public/img/sample 360/
# Local DB dump (owner-only; real users/bcrypt hashes/OAuth subjects). Ignore ONLY
# this exact file so a broad `git add` cannot commit it. Narrow on purpose: this
# does NOT ignore database/schema.sql, database/supabase/*.sql, or the tracked
# database/drop_student_section_status.sql helper.
database/campusphere_db.sql

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# M12.P1-R8 — owner-only local artifacts, excluded from the clean snapshot.
#
# Every rule below is ROOT-ANCHORED with a leading slash on purpose. The
# repository legitimately ships images (public/img/**, public/vendor/**), an
# HTML shell (public/offline.html), and Markdown throughout, so an unanchored
# *.png / *.html / *.md rule would silently drop real application content from
# the deployment package. These rules therefore match the project root ONLY.
#
# Nothing here is deleted or moved — the files stay in the working tree as
# owner property; they are simply not part of the committed snapshot.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Local Playwright MCP capture directory (browser-verification scratch).
/.playwright-mcp/

# Root-level screenshots and image evidence from manual verification runs.
/*.png
/*.jpg
/*.jpeg
/*.gif
/*.webp

# Root-level document exports (defense/presentation material, not source).
/*.pdf
/*.docx
/*.pptx
/*.html

# Superseded root-level change proposal, retained locally for reference only.
/Proposed_changes.md
